    "detailed_description": "Experience freedom of movement like never before in <strong>Hyper Hook</strong>!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Hook and Swing</h2>Learn how to master a highly responsive double hook system, allowing you to make very precise moves and avoid all the obstacles.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Hook &amp; Seek</h2>Show your skill in a game mode that does not limit your movements!<br><br>Find and hook all the spheres as fast as possible and replay each level with the knowledge of your previous runs, to go even faster and find the optimal trajectories!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build</h2>Use the map builder tool to create any level you want, and make the ultimate grappling hook experience!",
    "about_the_game": "Experience freedom of movement like never before in <strong>Hyper Hook</strong>!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Hook and Swing</h2>Learn how to master a highly responsive double hook system, allowing you to make very precise moves and avoid all the obstacles.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Hook &amp; Seek</h2>Show your skill in a game mode that does not limit your movements!<br><br>Find and hook all the spheres as fast as possible and replay each level with the knowledge of your previous runs, to go even faster and find the optimal trajectories!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build</h2>Use the map builder tool to create any level you want, and make the ultimate grappling hook experience!",
